<mxCell id="c69" value="opt [GHN code present]: GhnTrackingTimeline calls GET /api/shipping/ghn/track/:code through ShippingController -&gt; GhnService. Poll every 30s (5s for simulation) until terminal. Errors/stale data keep a warning; the UI never invents delivery confirmation." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="2013" width="2140" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c70" value="/orders/track requires phone + order code, not JWT, and does not write orders/commissions. The separate GHN journey GET may store evidence. Legacy GHTK wording does not imply an automatic GHTK adapter.&#xa;The timeline switch lacks RETURN_REQUESTED/DISPUTED cases. This diagram does not substitute intended behavior for the current fallback label." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2127" width="2180" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
