<mxCell id="c72" value="This is a static code finding; no review was submitted to the group DB. Unify the token mechanism and FE/BE contract in a separate fix before accepting public review.&#xa;OrderTrackingPage allows DELIVERED to open the modal, while reviewService.verifyOrder requires COMPLETED. The diagram preserves this inconsistency." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2240" width="2180" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
