<mxCell id="c87" value="Body source values are shopee/tiktok/shopify; secrets are scoped to Shop/source. This is an intake endpoint, not automatic marketplace account linking or native signature verification for each platform.&#xa;Database uniqueness uses Shop + sourcePlatform + externalOrderSn. A duplicate without a timestamp cannot overwrite data. Invalid payload/SKU/totals return 400; invalid transitions return 409; transaction failures&#xa;roll back.&#xa;Webhook intake does not decrement stock, create commissions, credit wallets or assign KOL attribution. FR-21 runs separately only if the order has valid attribution." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2692" width="1830" height="124" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
