<mxCell id="c102" value="Stock is locked/checked but not decremented or reserved in this reconciliation path. Saving a manual order does not call GHN quote/shipment creation.&#xa;Transaction timeout is 30s. Failure cannot leave partial order/items/coupon consumption within one order. An existing custom externalOrderSn returns 409, not a requestId replay.&#xa;createManualOrderForStore does not assign coupon KOL attribution to Order.attributedCollaboratorId. This diagram does not assume every manual order generates commission." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3117" width="2180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
