<mxCell id="c80" value="Checkout snapshots include base+tier+deal+campaign+live, capped at 25%. The engine preserves them. Legacy fallback uses only base10+tier0-3 and cannot reconstruct historical deal/campaign/live bonuses.&#xa;CommissionSchedulerService skips execution when DISABLE_SCHEDULED_JOBS=true. A failed candidate increments failed; processing continues for other candidates.&#xa;A manual/webhook order without attribution is not a commission candidate. Product commission rates alone do not identify a KOL." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2424" width="2180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
