<mxCell id="c68" value="availableAt is computed at commission creation using the configured holiday list; cron compares the stored timestamp. No automatic bank reconciliation or identity verification occurs after 14 days.&#xa;RETURN_REQUESTED/DISPUTED are ineligible for approval. Zero commissions are approved immediately at creation. Legacy storeWalletTracked=false updates only the global wallet." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1956" width="1830" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
