<mxCell id="c96" value="Concurrent requests for the same KOL wait on the Wallet lock and read committed balances after acquiring it. Insufficient funds cause rollback regardless of the FE preview. Locks do not deduplicate two otherwise valid requests." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="3136" width="2140" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="c97" value="FR-22 makes no bank transfer. Tax is included in gross and is not debited separately; FR-24 approval does not debit again. Payout/ledger failures roll back both wallets.&#xa;PayoutsController handles /wallets/withdrawals; WalletsController handles /wallets/me and /me/ledger. The default minimum is 200,000 and is configurable through MIN_PAYOUT_AMOUNT." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3250" width="2180" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
