<mxCell id="c101" value="A receipt does not automatically verify bank settlement. Approval does not call a bank transfer API, debit the wallet again or set Commission.PAID.&#xa;The current FE calls POST /payouts/:id/approve with optional bankRefCode and PDF support. The legacy scoped PATCH approval route still exists but is not called by payoutService.approve.&#xa;All list/bill/batch reads require Shop authorization. Upload happens before the database transaction with compensating cleanup; Prisma cannot roll back Cloudinary storage." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="3035" width="2180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
