<mxCell id="c91" value="Export moves PENDING to PROCESSING without prior approval. After an external bank transfer, the Shop uploads a separate receipt to approve each payout through FR-24A.&#xa;The file is a reconciliation workbook with VietQR Quick Links, not a universal bank import format. Generating a URL does not transfer money. Opening it shares beneficiary information with the VietQR provider.&#xa;A downloaded batch can include payouts approved after export; downloading is not an instruction to pay again. Export creates no wallet debit or new financial ledger entry." style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=16;fontColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=15;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacing=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2735" width="2180" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
